IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lsl-dates`
IMPORT `lsl-rules`
IMPORT `lsl-seat`

-- Long Service Leave Act 2018 (Vic) -- worked cases for the employee's questions (lsl-seat.l4), the s 16 formulas, the
-- deadline rules and the date helpers. Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text and the formulas
-- sidecar; none was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not
-- about the law. The facts are illustrative. Breached traces are asserted with CONSIDER ... WHEN FULFILLED (EVALTRACE ...
-- EQUALS cannot test a breach).
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`

§§ `Dates`

#ASSERT `is a leap year` 2028
#ASSERT NOT (`is a leap year` 2100)
-- 29 February plus 7 years falls on 28 February 2023; 12 weeks after 1 January 2026 is 26 March 2026 (30 + 28 + 26 days).
#ASSERT `the same day` 7 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2016) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2023
#ASSERT `the same day` 6 `years after` (`d` 15 3 2020) EQUALS `d` 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `the date` 12 `weeks after` (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 26 3 2026
#ASSERT `the days from` (`d` 1 1 2018) `to` (`d` 1 1 2025) EQUALS 2557

§§ `s 5 -- does the Act apply to me`

#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the Act applies to me`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the Act applies to me, except where it is inconsistent with the other Victorian Act or the more favourable agreement (s 5(a), (b))`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the Act applies to me, except where it is inconsistent with the other Victorian Act or the more favourable agreement (s 5(a), (b))`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the Act does not apply to me (s 5(c), (d) or (e))`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the Act does not apply to me (s 5(c), (d) or (e))`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the Act does not apply to me (s 5(c), (d) or (e))`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 11 -- one employer`

-- First start 1 February 2015. Dismissed 1 June 2019; 12 weeks after is 24 August 2019 (29 + 31 + 24 days).
`first start` MEANS `d` 1 2 2015
`dismissed` MEANS `d` 1 6 2019
`last day in time` MEANS `d` 24 8 2019
`a day late` MEANS `d` 25 8 2019

#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `there is no earlier employer or business` `first start` (`d` 1 7 2019) `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `d` 1 7 2019
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `my earlier employer was a related body corporate, or had substantially the same directors or management (s 11(2))` `first start` (`d` 1 7 2019) `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `the business changed owner and my employment continued (s 11(3))` `first start` (`d` 1 7 2019) `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `the assets I worked with were transferred and the new owner continued my employment (s 11(6))` `first start` (`d` 1 7 2019) `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `my work was contracted out and I moved to the contractor as a consequence (s 11(9), (10))` `first start` (`d` 1 7 2019) `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `the old owner dismissed me and the new owner re-employed me on the same or substantially the same work (s 11(5))` `first start` `last day in time` `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `the old owner dismissed me and the new owner re-employed me on the same or substantially the same work (s 11(5))` `first start` `a day late` `dismissed` `a day late` EQUALS `a day late`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `I was dismissed, the assets I worked with were transferred, and the new employer employed me to work with them or similar assets (s 11(7), (8))` `first start` `last day in time` `dismissed` `last day in time` EQUALS `first start`
#ASSERT `From what day is my employment counted` `I was dismissed, the assets I worked with were transferred, and the new employer employed me to work with them or similar assets (s 11(7), (8))` `first start` `a day late` `dismissed` `a day late` EQUALS `a day late`

§§ `s 12 -- continuous employment`

`any day` MEANS `d` 1 1 2020
`no gap reason` MEANS `none of these reasons`

