§§ `ss 9, 10, 34 -- the end of employment and death`

-- 7 years exactly at $1500 a week: 2557/420 x 1500 = 63925 / 7 (about $9132.14). A day short of 7 years: nothing.
#ASSERT `How much must I be paid when my employment ends` (`d` 1 1 2018) (`d` 31 12 2024) 0 0 1500 EQUALS 63925 DIVIDED BY 7
#ASSERT `How much must I be paid when my employment ends` (`d` 1 1 2018) (`d` 30 12 2024) 0 0 1500 EQUALS 0
-- 10 years, 2 weeks taken, $2000 a week: 2813/420 x 2000 = 281300 / 21 (about $13 395.24).
#ASSERT `How much must I be paid when my employment ends` (`d` 1 7 2015) (`d` 30 6 2025) 0 2 2000 EQUALS 281300 DIVIDED BY 21
-- Paid on time: the day employment ended, or earlier; late from the next day.
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 5000 (`d` 30 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 30 6 2026) (`d` 1 8 2026) EQUALS `paid in full on or before the day my employment ended`
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 5000 (`d` 30 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 15 6 2026) (`d` 1 8 2026) EQUALS `paid in full on or before the day my employment ended`
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 5000 (`d` 30 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 7 2026) (`d` 1 8 2026) EQUALS `paid in full, but late: it was due on the day my employment ended (s 9(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 5000 (`d` 30 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 30 6 2026) (`d` 30 6 2026) EQUALS `not yet paid in full, and due today (s 9(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 5000 (`d` 30 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 30 6 2026) (`d` 1 7 2026) EQUALS `not yet paid in full, and overdue since the day my employment ended: the obligation continues until it is paid (s 9(3))`
#ASSERT `Was my long service leave paid on time` 0 (`d` 30 6 2026) FALSE (`d` 30 6 2026) (`d` 1 7 2026) EQUALS `nothing is owed under s 9`
-- The s 9(2) rule itself: a part payment on the day does not count.
#ASSERT `done in time under` (`s 9(2) -- pay the full amount on the day the employment ends` 5000) `by` `my employer` `doing` (`pay my long service leave` 5000) `on day` 0
#ASSERT NOT (`done in time under` (`s 9(2) -- pay the full amount on the day the employment ends` 5000) `by` `my employer` `doing` (`pay my long service leave` 4999) `on day` 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`done in time under` (`s 9(2) -- pay the full amount on the day the employment ends` 5000) `by` `my employer` `doing` (`pay my long service leave` 5000) `on day` 1)
-- Payments in lieu (s 34).
